<v Maya>back.</v>

90
00:10:25.202 --> 00:10:39.520
<v Daniel>I want to bring in another piece of the puzzle here because it ties perfectly into this. The same lead author, Julian De Freitas, published a paper in 2024 looking at this exact same replica event. But back in 2024, they framed it as identity</v>

