100
00:11:35.922 --> 00:11:50.563
<v Daniel>Okay, but I have to push back here. Because I think a lot of people listening to this are probably feeling a deep sense of skepticism. I mean, I'm sorry, but I just don't buy that people are literally crying over code. Aren't they just doing that Internet thing where they complain as loudly as</v>

101
00:11:50.603 --> 00:11:51.003
