<v Maya>permanently lose their AI companion. But to test for that general venting you mentioned, they also asked them to rate the loss of a favorite brand, an app, a game character, a voice assistant, a car, and as the ultimate strong test, a</v>

106
00:12:33.057 --> 00:12:33.277
