108
00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:51.554
<v Maya>They did. And the AI companion was mourned more than every single non-living entity on that list. It beat the car, the brand, the voice assistant. It came in second only to the pet. That is wild. And the gap between the AI and the pet was</v>

