118
00:13:58.958 --> 00:14:01.560
<v Maya>The sheer depth of these bonds is just astounding.</v>

119
00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:08.886
<v Daniel>It really is. And if you are listening to this right now thinking, I would never fall for that, this is crazy, the researchers actually measured that exact blind spot.</v>

