133
00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:18.330
<v Maya>Oh, I like that analogy.</v>

134
00:16:18.611 --> 00:16:18.811
<v Daniel>Like...</v>

135
00:16:19.171 --> 00:16:33.461
<v Maya>Refined sugar is just a massive dose of pure calories without the fiber, and our bodies weren't evolved to process it. A human friendship is like a complex carbohydrate. It takes work to digest. There's friction. You have arguments. You compromise. But the AI is just pure, frictionless</v>

136
00:16:33.521 --> 00:16:42.867
